:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:stitch-design-taste Name:stitch-design-taste Description:Semantic Design System Skill for Google Stitch. Generates agent-friendly DESIGN.md files that enforce premium, anti-generic UI standards — strict typography, calibrated color, asymmetric layouts, perpetual micro-motion, and hardware-accelerated performance. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/stitch-design-taste Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:system-prompts Name:system-prompts Description:Write system prompts, tool docs, and agent definitions. Project tag conventions + RFC 2119 keywords + dense compression. Use when authoring or editing any prompt the model reads. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/system-prompts Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:systematic-debugging Name:systematic-debugging Description:Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/systematic-debugging Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:11} {Key:tavily-search Name:tavily-search Description:Search the web with LLM-optimized results via the Tavily CLI. Use this skill when the user wants to search the web, find articles, look up information, get recent news, discover sources, or says "search for", "find me", "look up", "what's the latest on", "find articles about", or needs current information from the internet. Returns relevant results with content snippets, relevance scores, and metadata — optimized for LLM consumption. Supports domain filtering, time ranges, and multiple search depths. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/tavily-search Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:tdd Name:tdd Description:Test-driven development. Use when the user wants to build features or fix bugs test-first, mentions "red-green-refactor", or wants integration tests. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/tdd Provider:grok R